    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰγι-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>obliquity</i>, of the
			sun's course, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				11.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in
			Obstetrics, <i>oblique presentation</i> of the foetus, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
