			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Gramm., <i>use of oblique cases</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>; <i>inflexion</i>, Sch.rec.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				365
			</span></i>.</div>
